    <sec id="sec_1" sec-type="scope">
      <label>1</label>
      <title>范围</title>
      <p>本文件规定了引用的写法。</p>
      <p>本文件使用缩略语<xref ref-type="abbreviation" rid="abb_1">ADC</xref>与<xref ref-type="abbreviation" rid="abb_3">CT</xref>。</p>
      <p>本文件的符号<inline-graphic xlink:href="inl_1" specific-use="size:M"/>见<xref ref-type="fig" rid="fig_1">图1</xref>。</p>
      <p>术语见<xref ref-type="custom" custom-type="term-entry" rid="term_3.1">协会</xref>，领域术语见<xref ref-type="custom" custom-type="term-entry" rid="term_3.3.1">技术规范</xref>。</p>
      <p>见引言<xref ref-type="sec" rid="sec_0.1">0.1</xref>与<xref ref-type="sec" rid="sec_0.1.1">0.1.1</xref>。</p>
    </sec>
